# ─── Real test fixtures stay LOCAL ONLY ──────────────────────────────
# Per docs/test_plan.md § 7, real agency + real talent fixtures live
# at ~/.nativ/test_fixtures/ outside the repo. If someone misplaces a
# copy inside the repo, gitignore catches it. CI synthetic fixtures
# live under tests/fixtures/synthetic/ which IS committed.
.nativ/
tests/fixtures/real/
tests/fixtures/_real/

# ─── Generated reports ───────────────────────────────────────────────
reports/

# ─── Misc temp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
.tmp/
